    "ledgerClosedAt": "2024-07-01T12:00:05Z",
    "note": "Base fee is reported in stroops and normalized XLM units."
  }
}
```

</details>

### `GET /network/validators`

Returns the current validator list from Horizon, normalized and grouped by home domain (organisation). Each entry includes the public key, home domain, current status, and last-modified ledger.

This endpoint is useful for tools that monitor the health and diversity of the Stellar validator network.

