### `GET /network/ledger-timing`

Analyzes the close-time intervals across the last 10 ledgers and returns statistical summary fields: average close time, minimum, maximum, standard deviation, and a `consistency` label (`stable`, `variable`, or `unstable`).

This is useful for monitoring tools and dashboards that need to surface network health degradation in real time.

